5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I worry about the people who actually run these plans. Who is left in the rosters?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We keep repeating old ideas. I need to see what happened the last time we tried this.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Schemes stall for reasons not in the drawings. I need to know who else has to say yes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,The budget arguments are exhausting. I want to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Complaints say it is crowded, but I suspect the time is lost elsewhere. I will check the journey audits.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, if the crews are thin, the maintenance windows will slip.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, exactly. If the people aren't there, the plan is just paper.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, I am looking at the committee minutes. Consents are a hidden bottleneck.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, if the time is in waiting, the ticketing fees might be a red herring.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, yes. I want to see where the minutes actually go.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the roster books. We need to know the late-turn capacity.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will look at the two pilots from eight years ago. Data beats enthusiasm.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the contingency pricing. The ground might hide surprises.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the capital ledger balances. I need to see the real commitment.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will check the timed runs. I want to see if the crowds are real.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
