35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The roster books are worrying. The late-turn pool is thin, and overtime is covering everything.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The pilots from eight years ago were successful. The late-evening pilot met its cost target.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The committee minutes show the ferry and rail back offices never agreed on data terms.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The ledger shows a ring-fenced construction balance, but the operating subsidy was trimmed again.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The timed runs are slower, but the crowd counts show platforms clearing at the old rate.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, if the back offices can't agree, any integrated plan is stuck.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, the late-evening pilot worked. That suggests night service is viable.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the pilots are old. The current committee is more fragmented.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, if the platforms are clearing, the crowding complaints are misleading.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, yes. The journey audits show the time is lost in waiting, not paying.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"The maintenance contract has spare capacity for lifts, but the roadway crews are a third below establishment.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"The accessibility programme records show four lift rebuilds finished on time, but lane-priority stretches failed.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The contingency pricing is high for pre-war shells. Three jobs stopped for weeks due to voids.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The ticketing fees exceed the paving budget. That is a significant drain on the operating line.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"The journey audits confirm it. Most added minutes are waiting for connections, not ticketing.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
